  "caveats": [
    "The result JSON date has one-second resolution; derived window boundaries are therefore approximately plus or minus one second.",
    "The synchronized method excludes timestamps missing any GPU and retained only 142/179 seconds for job 589394 and 321/459 seconds for job 589520.",
    "Cross-GPU averaging before percentile calculation suppresses individual prefill excursions. The narrow OCI p95 is a p95 of fleet-average W/GPU, not a pooled per-GPU p95.",
    "The 24-GPU pooled prefill mean exceeds its p95 because a small number of approximately 800 W prefill observations occur in a distribution otherwise concentrated near 240 W.",
